logic	kd
atom	end_continuation	the end of conjunction between male and female is not barely procreation but the continuation of the species
atom	young_need	the young are to be sustained by those that got them till they are able to shift and provide for themselves
atom	last_while_needed	the conjunction betwixt male and female lasts, even after procreation, so long as is necessary to the nourishment and support of the young ones
atom	maker_rule	this rule is one which the infinite wise maker hath set to the works of his hands
atom	creatures_obey	the inferior creatures steadily obey this rule
atom	grass_teat_sufficient	in viviparous animals which feed on grass, the teat of the dam is sufficient to nourish the young, and the male can contribute nothing to their sustenance
atom	grass_short	in viviparous animals which feed on grass, the conjunction lasts no longer than the very act of copulation
atom	prey_male_needed	in beasts of prey, the assistance of the male is necessary to the maintenance of their common family
atom	prey_longer	in beasts of prey, the conjunction lasts longer
atom	bird_young_need_food	in birds, the young need food in the nest
atom	bird_mates_continue	in birds, the cock and hen continue mates till the young are able to use their wing and provide for themselves
